Subject: sprite hosts live in one shelf Kobalte hides with one write

What: ensureSvgSpriteHost puts every sprite host in one `display: contents` shelf
at the top of <body>; the shelf itself is not aria-hidden.
Why: Kobalte's hide-outside pass (every menu, dialog and popover) skips an element
that is already aria-hidden without recording it and walks into it, writing
aria-hidden on each <symbol>: about 500 writes to open the account menu and 168 to
close it with the hosts directly in <body>. The shelf is hidden with one write.

